Type: Project
Title: Duplicate Place Names: Churches and Museums
Description: Dependency declaration for the analysis pipeline behind a series
    of blog posts on duplicated institutional names in the United States.
    This is NOT an R package — "Type: Project" is renv's convention for a
    project that wants explicit dependency declaration. The file exists so
    renv snapshots what the project has committed to, rather than inferring
    it from whichever packages happen to be referenced in code today; a
    package planned but not yet called (see the Phase 1 stubs in R/) would
    otherwise be silently dropped from renv.lock.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4)
Imports:
